This test passes, but the API is returning the id as a string. Why?

```js
import assert from 'node:assert';
test('user shape', () => {
  assert.deepEqual(getUser(), { id: 1, name: 'Ada' }); // returns { id: '1', name: 'Ada' }
});
```

