  [util.inspect.custom]() { return `Money(${this.cents / 100})`; }
}
console.log({ total: new Money(250) });
```

A team wants to record every incoming HTTP request in an observability tool without wrapping or monkey-patching the `http` module. Which built-in mechanism fits?

```js
import dc from 'node:diagnostics_channel';
dc.subscribe('http.server.request.start', ({ request }) => {
  record(request.method, request.url);
});
```
